The module contains stylesheets, drawn SVG files, one typeface and Go code. It contains no game artwork, no text taken from the game,
no logo and no third-party code. See PROVENANCE.md for where each part comes from.

The module imports the Go standard library only. It has no third-party dependency, so it carries no third-party Go licence text.
A test (boundary_test.go) fails if that ever changes; a change would be listed here first.

